WEBVTT

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:06.470
Who is that? Who? Who?

00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:12.740
That is the devil! Devilman! Devilman!

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.540
DEVILMAN

00:00:14.540 --> 00:00:22.020
This man took on the name "traitor"
He threw away everything to fight

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:25.760
His Devil Arrow is a supersonic wave
His Devil Ears can hear anything

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.430
His Devil Wing lets him fly through the air
His Devil Beam is a ray of heat

00:00:29.660 --> 00:00:36.410
With the power of a devil inside him

00:00:36.700 --> 00:00:45.280
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:00:49.080 --> 00:00:56.430
This man first learned of human love
That kindness awakened him

00:00:56.720 --> 00:01:00.630
His Devil Chop has punching power
His Devil Kick has destructive power

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:04.290
His Devil Eye has X-ray power
His Devil Cutter can break through rocks

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:11.440
With the power of a devil inside him

00:01:11.730 --> 00:01:20.350
He's a hero who fights for justice
Devilman Devilman

00:01:34.590 --> 00:01:36.820
I am Xenon!

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:40.090
I am the one who reigns
over the Demon Tribe.

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.600
I call out in the name
of the Demon Lord;

00:01:42.600 --> 00:01:46.140
Appear before me, Demon Marshal!

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:53.370
The stars are moving!

00:01:53.380 --> 00:01:54.580
The constellations are changing!

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:12.140
DEMON JEWEL
ENDLESS DESIRES

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:20.440
What's that?

00:02:30.410 --> 00:02:34.120
Demon Marshal Lacock
has answered your summons.

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:37.320
I've been awaiting you, Demon Marshal.

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:42.130
As you know, I require your
help in defeating the humans.

00:02:43.930 --> 00:02:46.460
Even Xenon is put out, I see.

00:02:46.460 --> 00:02:49.200
Humans count for little.

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:53.330
Devilman interferes, and even
General Muxan was defeated.

00:02:53.340 --> 00:02:58.680
Any demons sent to Earth are
as useful as bodies without heads!

00:02:59.140 --> 00:03:01.610
You want me to succeed Muxan, then?

00:03:01.610 --> 00:03:03.850
It may be too trivial
a task for you, but...

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:07.180
Be not so reserved, Lord Xenon.

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:10.160
I shall see to it with pleasure.

00:03:12.820 --> 00:03:14.060
In exchange...

00:03:14.060 --> 00:03:19.200
I know. I shall abdicate
the throne in favor of you.

00:03:21.360 --> 00:03:23.240
Thank you.

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:29.720
I, Demon Marshal Lacock,

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:33.350
will do my best for Lord Xenon.

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:36.250
I swear it.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:44.060
I'm counting on you, Demon Marshal.

00:03:48.660 --> 00:03:52.160
A MYSTERIOUS PHENOMENON
ON A WINTER NIGHT
MASS HALLUCINATION AMONG
AMATEUR ASTRONOMERS

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:55.500
It's the Demon Marshal!
There's no mistaking it!

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:58.730
She has finally arrived.

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:01.740
She's a female demon, but there's a
world of difference between her and Lala.

00:04:01.740 --> 00:04:03.570
She'll be a tough one.

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:05.910
Akira, what are you doing?

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:07.110
All right, I'm coming!

00:04:08.810 --> 00:04:13.810
SHOCHIKUBAI MENTAL HOSPITAL

00:04:13.820 --> 00:04:15.450
Release me!

00:04:15.450 --> 00:04:17.730
Come on, release me!

00:04:18.120 --> 00:04:20.960
Come on, let me out now!

00:04:22.460 --> 00:04:26.270
Let me out bastards!
Are you deaf? Hurry up!

00:04:32.430 --> 00:04:34.610
With a little twist...

00:04:43.310 --> 00:04:46.260
5TH WARD

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:48.820
Get her!

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:53.560
- How's that?
- Damn! Damn!

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:58.900
You're so cruel!
I won't forget this!

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:03.330
Enough! This is the fourth
time you've tried to escape.

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:07.540
You're wrong. This makes five!

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:09.040
Silence, you're the patient!

00:05:12.010 --> 00:05:14.240
I can't take care of such
a difficult patient.

00:05:14.240 --> 00:05:16.480
If it gets out that patients
can escape this easily,

00:05:16.480 --> 00:05:19.120
we'll have a hard time operating!

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:21.650
What do you propose we do, doctor?

00:05:21.650 --> 00:05:23.380
We have no choice.

00:05:23.390 --> 00:05:24.630
We'll get rid of her!

00:05:26.320 --> 00:05:28.660
Tie an anchor to her and
throw her in the sea.

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:31.640
Make a smaller sacrifice
for the sake of a greater good.

00:05:31.960 --> 00:05:33.830
Wipe away the tears,
and make a difference!

00:05:33.830 --> 00:05:38.140
Who cares what happens after?
If she dies, that's the end of it.

00:05:38.470 --> 00:05:40.640
Doctor, you're so deep!

00:05:58.120 --> 00:05:59.830
Where are you, Demon Marshal?

00:06:00.190 --> 00:06:03.690
I can't see her, but you can't
see stars during the day, either.

00:06:03.690 --> 00:06:07.770
Doesn't mean she's not up there
somewhere, sharpening her claws.

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:33.820
My Jewel!
My precious Jewel!

00:06:33.820 --> 00:06:36.100
Make friends with the humans!

00:06:48.740 --> 00:06:50.720
- There!
- Here!

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:53.010
Here! Here!

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:54.750
Here!

00:06:58.410 --> 00:06:59.950
It's a jewel!

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:01.590
Oh my!

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:21.280
What is this?

00:07:50.300 --> 00:07:51.040
Jewels?!

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:54.840
This is amazing!

00:07:54.840 --> 00:07:56.780
- Jewels!
- Move it!

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:12.030
Was there an accident?

00:08:18.230 --> 00:08:20.470
What's this? Incredible!

00:08:31.840 --> 00:08:33.110
Gimme that!

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:37.880
What the? What's going on?

00:08:39.250 --> 00:08:41.890
Diamonds! Rubies! Opals!

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:44.490
Sapphires! Emeralds!

00:08:45.520 --> 00:08:46.520
Let’s go!

00:08:58.330 --> 00:09:02.110
Sure is noisy!
Another fender bender, huh?

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:06.180
Huh?

00:09:08.080 --> 00:09:10.110
Wow! What a beautiful jewel!

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:12.450
It looks like an amethyst.

00:09:13.280 --> 00:09:14.950
Can I keep it?

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:16.620
Of course you can.

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:34.740
Something fell!

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:40.740
It's a person!

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:43.240
They look like a sausage!

00:09:43.240 --> 00:09:46.150
Akira, hurry and help!

00:09:46.150 --> 00:09:48.980
It looks cold in there,
but I don't have a choice.

00:09:48.980 --> 00:09:50.830
I'm a hero who fights
for justice, after all!

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:14.950
Aw, my beauty has been sullied!

00:10:15.580 --> 00:10:16.850
You little...

00:10:17.850 --> 00:10:19.580
Come over here!

00:10:19.580 --> 00:10:22.120
What are you do--

00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:28.720
La-Lala!

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:30.130
Devilman!

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:33.260
How dare you put me
through such an ordeal!

00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:38.370
Behold my splendid powers!

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:45.980
Let's go!

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:49.380
What's that, a preschool craft?

00:10:49.380 --> 00:10:52.050
How dare you speak to me that way?

00:11:07.930 --> 00:11:10.640
You there! No loitering
on the sidewalk!

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:14.200
You don't understand!
Akira hasn't come back yet!

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:17.150
He jumped in there to help a woman.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.440
What's that? A woman, you say?

00:11:19.440 --> 00:11:21.920
If she's pretty, I should
probably go help!

00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:26.660
Wh-What kind of gem is that?

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:28.880
I found it on the street.

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:30.490
You found it?

00:11:32.290 --> 00:11:34.630
It looks like a jewel. A jewel!

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:38.060
Yup, definitely a jewel.

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:46.980
I have something to tell you.

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:51.870
People who love beautiful
and expensive things...

00:11:53.510 --> 00:11:55.540
Wonderful jewels for elites like you,
are there for the taking!

00:11:55.540 --> 00:12:00.250
With a little courage and a tiny bit of
initiative, these jewels can be yours.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:03.480
They are in a safe-deposit box at
the head office of Izumi Bank!

00:12:03.480 --> 00:12:05.420
Akira is taking so long!

00:12:05.420 --> 00:12:07.420
This is strange, even for him.

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:09.600
Hey, sir, go look... Huh?

00:12:10.560 --> 00:12:12.630
He's gone!

00:12:13.090 --> 00:12:14.730
My, where'd he go?

00:12:15.600 --> 00:12:17.600
What a useless teacher!

00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:20.010
There's nothing we can do.
Let's find a police box.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:28.810
You tease! I can't move!

00:12:28.810 --> 00:12:30.190
Let me see.

00:12:32.980 --> 00:12:34.390
Thank you!

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:35.960
Prepare yourself!

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:43.520
I can't bear to look.
Hurry up and fix your face!

00:12:43.520 --> 00:12:47.270
Okay. Hold this for a moment.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:50.370
Well?

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:52.430
Is this better?

00:12:52.430 --> 00:12:53.770
Good, you look pretty.

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:57.080
Well, are we gonna
keep fighting? Come on!

00:12:58.110 --> 00:12:59.310
Die, Devilman!

00:13:04.950 --> 00:13:06.080
One more!

00:13:07.650 --> 00:13:11.150
Oh no, it looks like shish Kabob!

00:13:11.150 --> 00:13:12.590
Want some more, Lala?

00:13:12.590 --> 00:13:14.260
No, I'm done!

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:17.930
Go and kill me! Kill me!

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:21.440
You should act your age, Lala!

00:13:22.260 --> 00:13:26.000
It would be better than returning to
the Demon Realm as a laughingstock.

00:13:26.000 --> 00:13:27.470
Just kill me, already!

00:13:27.470 --> 00:13:30.900
Enough! I don't want your
beauty to go to waste, Lala.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:33.470
You deserve to live longer.

00:13:33.470 --> 00:13:36.990
Don't lie to me, calling me beautiful!

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:42.450
Well, I am beautiful. You're right
about that Devilman!

00:13:42.720 --> 00:13:46.720
In truth, when I look in a
mirror, I enchant even myself!

00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:49.500
I'm a girl of rare beauty.

00:13:50.960 --> 00:13:52.430
And so modest!

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:55.000
So, of course, I would
never say so myself.

00:13:55.000 --> 00:13:58.370
But you clearly have good
taste if you praise me.

00:13:58.370 --> 00:14:01.070
Hey!
Huh? Huh?

00:14:03.710 --> 00:14:06.710
Devilman! Devilman!

00:14:06.710 --> 00:14:08.380
Where are you?

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:12.250
Why didn't you kill me?
Devilman!

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:14.230
Devilman!

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:22.660
I know why you didn't kill me.

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:25.630
My beauty caused your hands to tremble,

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:28.400
and you couldn't even
hurt me a little. Right?

00:14:28.400 --> 00:14:32.670
No, Devilman, it is you
who has been hurt!

00:14:33.030 --> 00:14:36.340
My charm has left a crack
in your head, hasn't it?

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:39.040
Aw, poor Devilman.

00:14:39.040 --> 00:14:40.540
You've gotta be kidding!

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:43.280
I've made up my mind!

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:47.380
I shall live with the man who has
recognized my charm, Devilman!

00:14:47.380 --> 00:14:51.560
Simple-headed Lala, who breaks
the law and dies at her post!

00:14:55.790 --> 00:14:58.100
TRAFFIC SAFETY

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:00.190
Officer!
We have a problem!

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:00.860
A MOMENT'S CARELESSNESS...

00:15:00.860 --> 00:15:04.330
- Two people fell in that river!
- Come quickly!

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:06.880
Shut up!

00:15:07.140 --> 00:15:08.310
LOOK BOTH WAYS

00:15:09.000 --> 00:15:13.350
Who cares about two people? There are a
hundred over there causing trouble! Look!

00:15:14.440 --> 00:15:15.240
IZUMI BANK

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:17.720
There's a mass burglary
at lzumi Bank!

00:15:21.720 --> 00:15:22.630
It's your teacher!

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:28.190
Mr. Alphonne's a bank robber?
Too cool!

00:15:37.700 --> 00:15:40.900
The scale of the bank robbery
is still increasing.

00:15:40.900 --> 00:15:44.770
But looking at the faces of the
culprits, they don't look like professionals.

00:15:44.770 --> 00:15:49.540
We're seeing teachers, celebrities, and
housewives mixed in with the crowd.

00:15:49.540 --> 00:15:53.180
At this rate, it seems unlikely
that the police will interfere.

00:15:55.450 --> 00:15:58.020
They've broken into the vault!

00:15:58.020 --> 00:16:00.420
One after another, the
criminals are jumping in...

00:16:00.420 --> 00:16:02.620
Well, if you'd excuse me...

00:16:02.620 --> 00:16:06.540
Who, me? I'm joining
them, of course.

00:16:13.070 --> 00:16:15.240
Jewel, excellent work.

00:16:15.240 --> 00:16:18.910
Vanity, mob mentality, mass hypnosis...

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:22.440
Your service to me by studying
humans has borne fruit.

00:16:23.310 --> 00:16:26.410
It is not worthwhile for us demons
to kill the humans ourselves.

00:16:26.410 --> 00:16:29.220
It is better to let them
fight amongst themselves!

00:16:29.220 --> 00:16:33.760
Your compliments honor
me, Demon Marshal!

00:16:40.530 --> 00:16:44.980
Well, that's great!
Thanks to her, I'm lost.

00:16:46.670 --> 00:16:47.940
A way out!

00:16:55.140 --> 00:16:58.810
Do not hesitate! Empty the vault!

00:16:58.810 --> 00:17:00.810
Just a little more, everyone!

00:17:00.820 --> 00:17:02.290
That voice!

00:17:06.390 --> 00:17:07.660
You're Demon Jewel!

00:17:12.360 --> 00:17:13.340
You!

00:17:14.060 --> 00:17:18.200
DEVIL!

00:17:28.580 --> 00:17:30.020
Devil Cutter!

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:37.360
Damn!

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:42.420
Diamond rings!

00:17:42.420 --> 00:17:45.860
In other words, the hardest
saws in existence.

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:48.740
Please enjoy the moderate pain.

00:17:59.840 --> 00:18:01.180
Damn!

00:18:21.860 --> 00:18:24.930
As you know, diamonds are unbreakable.

00:18:24.930 --> 00:18:29.570
Even you are powerless against my drill!

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:53.100
Devil Beam!

00:19:00.900 --> 00:19:02.900
Diamonds are hard, but
they can still burn!

00:19:02.900 --> 00:19:04.970
Too bad for you, Demon Jewel.

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.170
Is that you, Lala?

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:24.670
Devilman, you're so strong!

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:29.200
That’s why you’re my boyfriend!

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:31.700
H-Hey! Knock that off!

00:19:31.700 --> 00:19:34.130
Goodness, you're so shy!

00:19:34.140 --> 00:19:36.880
That's fine. I shall remain
by your side from now on.

00:19:38.470 --> 00:19:42.740
You saved me.
And I saved you.

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:44.310
What a deep wound!

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:45.650
That tickles!

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:48.050
Devilman!

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:53.050
How dare you turn
my precious Jewel to ash?!

00:19:53.490 --> 00:19:56.390
I will see that you pay dearly for this!

00:19:56.390 --> 00:19:59.670
When the time comes,
it will be too late for you to repent!

00:20:06.400 --> 00:20:08.270
— Akira!

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:08.840
- Akira!

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:10.640
Whoops!

00:20:10.640 --> 00:20:13.470
What have you been doing?
Come down now!

00:20:13.470 --> 00:20:15.650
All right, okay!

00:20:21.320 --> 00:20:23.250
My future looks pretty grim.

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:26.560
Dammit!
It's tough looking this good!

00:20:44.910 --> 00:20:49.910
No one knows; no one may know

00:20:51.610 --> 00:20:56.610
Who Devilman really is

00:20:57.450 --> 00:21:04.270
No one speaks; no one may say

00:21:04.660 --> 00:21:10.110
Who Devilman really is

00:21:10.970 --> 00:21:14.030
In the world of man, there is love

00:21:14.030 --> 00:21:17.270
In the world of man, there are dreams

00:21:17.270 --> 00:21:22.270
Wanting only to protect
these beautiful things,

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:33.120
Devilman is off, somewhere, today

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:53.150
No one knows; no one may know

00:21:54.070 --> 00:21:59.350
Where Devilman comes from

00:21:59.850 --> 00:22:04.850
No one speaks; no one may say

00:22:06.990 --> 00:22:11.990
Where Devilman comes from

00:22:13.390 --> 00:22:16.730
For he can never go home again

00:22:16.730 --> 00:22:19.730
He wanders on a journey

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:26.410
Now that he understands peace

00:22:26.870 --> 00:22:36.550
He'll be Devilman again,
somewhere, tomorrow

00:22:59.010 --> 00:23:00.240
Go now, Miniyon.

00:23:00.240 --> 00:23:02.740
Demonstrate your power to the humans!

00:23:07.550 --> 00:23:09.820
As you wish!

00:23:09.820 --> 00:23:14.820
I shall go to the human world
and kill that detestable Devilman!

00:23:15.720 --> 00:23:16.830
om gm!

00:23:22.660 --> 00:23:26.010
What a lot of nonsense.

00:23:26.400 --> 00:23:28.000
What's that?

00:23:37.280 --> 00:23:41.950
Using the devil's brooch, Demon
Miniyon attacks one human after another,

00:23:41.950 --> 00:23:44.680
turning them into miniature humans.

00:23:44.690 --> 00:23:46.490
Tare! Help me!

00:23:46.490 --> 00:23:47.970
Miyo!

00:23:50.220 --> 00:23:52.290
You jerk!

00:23:52.290 --> 00:23:54.830
Give back my Miyo!

00:23:59.530 --> 00:24:01.340
You're so manly!

00:24:06.810 --> 00:24:07.880
Oh no!

00:24:09.340 --> 00:24:10.720
Devilman!

00:24:11.110 --> 00:24:12.720
Damn you, Miniyon!

00:24:15.980 --> 00:24:17.360
Where are you?

00:24:23.760 --> 00:24:26.790
Oh no!
It's so hot!

00:24:26.790 --> 00:24:29.900
Help me! Fire Safety!

00:24:32.830 --> 00:24:34.400
Fight, Devilman!

00:24:34.400 --> 00:24:36.200
Even if your body is small,

00:24:36.200 --> 00:24:39.620
you must not lose your boundless
courage and endless spirit.

00:24:40.270 --> 00:24:44.920
Next time on Devilman:
DEMON MINIYON, THE
DEVIL'S PENDANT
